{"job_id":"F-d718991bdb3f2b5d6043","family_id":"F-d718991bdb3f2b5d6043","title":"중국산 합판에 대한 덤핑방지관세 부과에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014684-263783-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":27,"target_id":"4fa404cedba090b6a61cf33077cc1fe18f8696b858d145fda8588b7d92ad0513","source_hash":"91e6d247c0ad0896f34c1748f2d7dbf6c44aedb23958cdc3680c4b187ae8ed95","text":"关于对中国产胶合板征收反倾销税的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014684-263783-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":86,"target_id":"981536b3ac2a8476387ef347d83cbe12b7300d0688d4625a6bf5327cd792864f","source_hash":"1a2180cc6d0a23473176e09b095aee2b985442fe6d501f1561d90af9fc54684e","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《海关法》第五十一条指定应缴纳反倾销税的商品和供应商，并规定适用于该等商品的关税税率。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014684-263783-ko","scope":"BODY","start":86,"end":240,"target_id":"60f795315bca79175a2deff68f918e54bb6e29045b4b43d1ad9f1dc2a7f7889b","source_hash":"5835c9152fa7109a3669e12034588bce304570a300e8d2d9b9109507595fab87","text":"第二条（征税对象） 应征收反倾销税的货物为原产于中国的胶合板（指根据《海关法实施令》第98条第1款规定，与海关和统计协调制度税号4412.31、4412.33或4412.34对应的胶合板）。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014684-263783-ko","scope":"BODY","start":240,"end":315,"target_id":"1a5aed6c625d96d2e49012972dd734a4d4a25cfd29c3fcbfd318f174603a3a0f","source_hash":"2a9a883534d346b34789a4e35bdba50415b359f2b1157b2c69b6940aa7b3ebdb","text":"第三条（受征税货物的供应商和反倾销税税率）根据第二条规定受征税货物的供应商以及各供应商的反倾销税税率如下表所示。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014684-263783-ko","scope":"BODY","start":315,"end":337,"target_id":"7ba8eacf0cfb3bcd294db88136b3b873c03dc1d5d94023ec62d66da5f12da3ba","source_hash":"0f429de9a48484c882ae3762a539dc74867f89febbee10edebad668e15c77019","text":"补充规定 <第1073号，2024年7月2日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014684-263783-ko","scope":"BODY","start":337,"end":367,"target_id":"67ff69938237d7fbd82b55dcae6955d84c44ffb1c0354423ade1f835b621824a","source_hash":"0d63a18201aaf2f1d98d1a1c71f36ac02